ref_dict.conj:
\begin{conjecture}\label{conj}
	There exists a function $f$ such that for every poset $P$, there exists a local realizer $\mathcal{L}$ of $P$ such that the frequency of $\mathcal{L}$ is exactly $\ldim(P)$ and the size of $\mathcal{L}$ is at most $f(\dim(P))$.
\end{conjecture}

ref_dict.th:lat_1_n_short_realizer:
